                <p>As a business owner in the Netherlands, you are pragmatic. You are "kostenbewust"—acutely aware of your costs. You track your rent, your payroll, and the price of your raw materials down to the last cent. You build budgets, analyze your profit and loss statement, and make decisions based on hard numbers.</p>

